  "events": [
    {
      "text": "Copper at the window. I am painting a small copper kettle against a cool ground. Today\u2019s goal: build filled curved forms with overlapping broad passes, then reserve one short reflected light. An ordinary kitchen kettle is the spark; this composition is imagined.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 10920,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The washes are three separate bands. I will bridge the cool field and lay a low contact shadow before placing the copper body.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The contact shadow is narrow and low. The background seams stay quiet for now; broad copper passes will establish the filled body before any outline.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6500,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "The body is fully filled and slightly angular at the bottom, with regular oil ridges. I will add an upward spout and a dark open handle to make the kettle silhouette clear.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "The kettle reads, but the handle is polygonal and the body has no lid or light structure yet. I will seat a shallow lid and put the darkest copper along the lower right.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8580,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "The lid separates from the body, but its upper arc and handle corners are hard. Smaller point intervals should soften turns. A broad warm plane will make room for a narrow cool reflection later.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8840,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "The handle\u2019s inner turn softened, although its outside remains faceted. The broad warm face is visible. I will test one cool vertical reflection on the upper left belly before adding any other lights.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8580,
      "afterStroke": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 19
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "The reflection is visible but blends warmly into copper. Keep its soft lower end; a shorter cooler center can suggest the window. The spout needs a dark mouth and the lid needs a small edge light.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9360,
      "afterStroke": 19
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 22
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
